exports[`F9-1 验证门禁：编辑后想直接收尾 → 撤回并追问 → 验证通过 → 记忆审计（对用户隐藏）→ 以审计前那句收工 1`] = `
← turn_start 0
→ model #1
  tools: Edit,Bash,MemoryAudit
  + user: text "把 a.ts 改一下"
← tool_start Edit#e1
← tool_end Edit#e1 ok "edited"
← turn_start 1
→ model #2
  + assistant: call Edit#e1 {"path":"a.ts"}
  + user: result #e1 ok "edited"
← text "改好了"
← turn_discard 1 (答复先撤回：改了代码，但还没有通过的验证，正在让它补跑检查)
← turn_start 2
→ model #3
  + assistant(internal): text "改好了"
  + user(internal): text "[Automated check] You have edited files without sufficient passing verification evidence. Do not declare the task done y…"
← tool_start Bash#v1
← tool_end Bash#v1 ok "test passed"
← turn_start 3
→ model #4
  + assistant: call Bash#v1 {"command":"npm test","verify":true,"pass":true}
  + user: result #v1 ok "exit 0"
← text "验证通过，改好了"
→ model #5
  + assistant: text "验证通过，改好了"
  + user(internal): text "[Memory audit required] Before finishing, inspect the memory index and decide whether this run produced durable knowledg…"
← done end
`;

exports[`F9-2 验证门禁追问用尽（V2）：三次追问都不验证 → 第四版放行并附「未验证」尾注 1`] = `
