  + user(internal): text "[Automated check] You have edited files without sufficient passing verification evidence. Do not declare the task done y…"
← text "好了 2"
← turn_discard 2 (答复先撤回：改了代码，但还没有通过的验证，正在让它补跑检查)
← turn_start 3
→ model #4
  + assistant(internal): text "好了 2"
  + user(internal): text "[Automated check] You have edited files without sufficient passing verification evidence. Do not declare the task done y…"
← text "好了 3"
← turn_discard 3 (答复先撤回：改了代码，但还没有通过的验证，正在让它补跑检查)
← turn_start 4
→ model #5
  + assistant(internal): text "好了 3"
  + user(internal): text "[Automated check] You have edited files without sufficient passing verification evidence. Do not declare the task done y…"
← text "好了 4⏎⏎> ⚠️ 未验证：这一轮改了 1 个文件，但没有通过的验证证据（门禁追问 3 次后放行），以上结论请自行核对。"
← done end
`;

