← turn_start 2
→ model #3
  + assistant(internal): call MemoryAudit#audit {"decision":"none","reason":"This synthetic gate scenario produces no durable pr…
  + user(internal): result #audit ok "Memory audit recorded as none: This synthetic gate scenario produces no durable project knowledge."
← text "改成蓝色了"
← done end
`;

